 =&gt; Supreme.<br><br>To unlock the later class, the player needs to fully upgrade the antecedent class. In the Hangar, it is possible to level up the ship with crystals, which are collected by destroying enemies. In addition, each ship has a passive which allows different types of builds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502730/extras/30358b5c43538341f7e45cb3ef6840da.avif?t=1745327821\" /></span><br><br>Each ship has 08 attributes that can be improved in the Hangar, they are:<br><br> - Attack<br> - Elemental Attack<br> - Speed<br> - Fire Rate<br> - Bomb Capacity<br> - Bomb Fire Rate<br> - Laser Cannons<br> - Life<br><br><strong>CPUs</strong><br><br>CPUs are equippable resources on the ship and there are 03 types of CPU:<br><br>Attributes: Improves the basic attributes of the ship.<br><br>Passives: Enables combat passives on the ship<br><br>Specials: Modifies or enables special features on the ship<br><br>CPUs are collected by destroying enemies and their rarity ranges from Common to Legendary. A slot is required to equip it  and each ship class has a permanent number of slots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502730/extras/e24824f40fc598824cf6fdded9c2ae51.poster.avif?t=1745327821\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502730/extras/e24824f40fc598824cf6fdded9c2ae51.webm?t=1745327821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502730/extras/e24824f40fc598824cf6fdded9c2ae51.mp4?t=1745327821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So pilot, let's survive the dangers of Shin Galaxy.",
